          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When the frequencies are larger and we cannot use the scale of 1 unit length = 1 number (frequency), we need to choose a different scale like we did in the case of pictographs."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.536,
            0.884,
            0.581
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ": The number of runs scored by Smriti in each of the 8 matches are given in the table below:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
